---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - Letter Lab" description="Terms of Service for Letter Lab text utilities.">
  <div class="px-6 md:px-40 flex flex-1 justify-center py-10">
    <div class="max-w-[800px] flex-1 text-[#111418]">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#637588] mb-8">Last updated: October 2025</p>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-[#4f5d6d] leading-relaxed">
            By accessing and using Letter Lab, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please discontinue use of our tools.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">2. Service Description & Availability</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-[#4f5d6d] leading-relaxed">
            Letter Lab provides web-based text transformation utilities on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind. We reserve the right to modify, suspend, or discontinue any aspect of the service at any time without prior notice.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">3. Data Processing & Privacy</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-[#4f5d6d] leading-relaxed mb-3">
            All text manipulation operations run exclusively on your local device (client-side) inside your web browser. Letter Lab does not store, log, or transmit input text to external databases.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-[#4f5d6d] leading-relaxed">
            General website utilization and performance metrics are processed in aggregate via Google Analytics (GTM-NBTNGL9D) and Yandex Metrika in accordance with our Privacy Policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-[#4f5d6d] leading-relaxed">
            Letter Lab and its creator shall not be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use of, or inability to use, our text utilities or output results.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">5. Contact Information</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-[#4f5d6d] leading-relaxed">
            If you have questions regarding these Terms of Service, feel free to visit our{" "}
            <a href="/about" class="text-[#3289e7] font-semibold hover:underline">About Page</a>,{" "}
            connect via{" "}
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sergei-tikhomirov-pm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#3289e7] font-semibold hover:underline">LinkedIn</a>,{" "}
            or open an issue on{" "}
            <a href="https://github.com/Sidspirit/letterlab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#3289e7] font-semibold hover:underline">GitHub</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>